    "message": "A v3 change involving changing Combine overloads with PathFormat parameters to RelativePathFormat parameters instead had to be reverted back to previous v2.x behavior due to an important use-case that would have not been facilitated by the new setup. Please update to v3.0.1 and continue using the same patterns that you used in v2.x to combine paths.",
